  "body": "(If I use matrix.org, I can create rooms, writing something into them, and new people can join and view old messages.)\r\n\r\nI just created my own homesever (with _matrix-docker-ansible-deploy_)\r\nI created a first user and created a group room.\r\nI immediatly checked that this option is selected (with element):\r\n```\r\nWho can read history?\r\n[*] Members only (since the point in time of selecting this option)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen I typed:\r\n_\"first message\"\r\n\"second message\"\r\n\"third message\"_\r\n\r\nThen I created a second user. I invited the second user, and joined inside the room.\r\n\r\nThe problem is that the second user can't see the first three messages. I can only see messages **after** I join.\r\nDo I need to do something with synapse?",
